{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fairy Tale Exploration Journey</strong><br>Each level is a whimsical adventure through fantastical storybook worlds. Our signature thick-painted hand-drawn art style makes every frame wallpaper-worthy - the game's true visual hallmark. Complemented by custom-crafted background music for each environment, this creates an immersive atmosphere that fully draws you into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.poster.avif?t=1774021118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.webm?t=1774021118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.mp4?t=1774021118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique storybook worlds + 1 secret chapter\u300130+ interactive NPC characters\u30011,200 collectible items to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Gameplay Features \u2726</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Main Quest</strong><br>Progress through the narrative by collecting yarn balls hidden across environments to unlock the game's true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Side Quests</strong><br>Help vibrant NPC characters by completing their item collection requests in different scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Secret Chapter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Postcard Mode by collecting canned food during main story progression, then gather Cat Collars from treasure chests in this mode to access bonus challenges and uncover hidden storylines! <i>(Psst... exclusive secret narrative included!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Artistic Discovery</strong><br>Explore richly textured painterly landscapes filled with classic IP-inspired Easter eggs and visual surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports the following languages: <br>Simplified Chinese,Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese - Brazil, and German.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yarnbound Chronicles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/11edc2c98d23faf9097d8c629edb4184190af372.jpg"},{"name":"Quintet Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/6f2f3ddecff3692172a8c47bbc310c709252d52e.jpg"},{"name":"Fifteen Starlight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/acd5d8a28c0fe06a6355642f5ca668ed03448784.jpg"},{"name":"Scorebound Tome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/6e122a013b864447df3a5c799827f43daef28aad.jpg"},{"name":"Thirtyfold Bounty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/1a959a9aeb795cc45fafa236522e48d8e0cade9e.jpg"},{"name":"Forty Splendors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/911cf0241629050c33381075998ab32f1d6a3ab8.jpg"},{"name":"Fifty Curios","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/e346e49e17c32078c61fe58a4bff19226c24f69a.jpg"},{"name":"Sixty Expeditions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603580/2b36279dbc87ec4294535095e121ae59ca1b40d1.jpg"},{"name":"Seventy Relics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/